{"id":"451413","name":"南瓜西红柿薏米汤","author":"企茶点茶档","authorId":"11132809","desc":"","cover":"images/451413/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"南瓜","amount":"半个"},{"name":"西红柿","amount":"3个"},{"name":"薏米","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"预备材料，清洗干净。","img":"images/451413/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"薏米要泡2小时，先下水煲15分钟。","img":"images/451413/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"西红柿切块，南瓜去皮去瓤切块。","img":"images/451413/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"煲了15分钟薏米，再下南瓜。","img":"images/451413/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"水开了。","img":"images/451413/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"下西红柿。","img":"images/451413/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"下盐调味，加入蛋浆，就可以熄火。","img":"images/451413/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"成了。","img":"images/451413/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}